<title>QATAR: Qatar Airways to get $19.2 mln government loan.</title>
<headline>Qatar Airways to get $19.2 mln government loan.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privately-owned Qatar Airways will receive a 70 million riyal ($19.2 million) government loan, the Qatar News Agency (QNA) reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Qatar's emir Sheikh Hamad bin Khalifa al-Thani issued a law approving a 70 million riyal loan to Qatar Airways,&quot; QNA said.</p>
<p>The agency did not give details of the loan terms.</p>
<p>($1=3.64 riyals)</p>
<p>YK HG</p>
